Package: auth-trace
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3,
         dbus,
         systemd
Recommends: xdotool,
            x11-utils
Description: record who triggers desktop authentication popups (UOS/DDE)
 auth-trace passively listens on the D-Bus system bus and the session bus
 and records every authentication request (polkit, deepin-authenticate,
 dde-authority, UDCP IAM auth-dialog, permission manager, ...) together
 with the calling process (pid, executable, command line, systemd unit)
 and, for polkit, the requested action id.
 .
 Captured events are stored on disk and rotated, so an intermittent
 authentication popup can be investigated after the fact.  Run
 "auth-trace-report <reproduction time>" to generate an evidence bundle
 that combines the captured D-Bus events, window records and journald
 logs for the given time window.
